<title>UK: NordLB sets 10 bln peseta step-up seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets 10 bln peseta step-up seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco De Negocios Argentaria, Banque Nationale de Paris and Banco Urquico.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON    *5.92	MATURITY    03.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE  FIX/REV FRN    ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.20	LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST THREE YEARS THEN 13.65 PCT LESS 12M LIBOR</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
